---
import Container from "../layout/Container.astro";
import Eyebrow from "../ui/Eyebrow.astro";
---
<section id="product" class="py-24 md:py-32">
  <Container>
    <div class="max-w-2xl"><Eyebrow icon>From unknown to understood</Eyebrow><h2 class="mt-4 text-balance text-[38px] font-semibold leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.04em] text-ink-1 md:text-[54px]">Identity is a starting point.<br /><span class="font-serif-italic font-normal">Evidence makes it useful.</span></h2><p class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-pretty text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-ink-2">Autonomous systems need more than an address before they delegate work, pay, or extend a limit.</p></div>
    <div class="value-props-flow mt-14" aria-label="Agent decision journey">
      <article class="value-props-stage value-props-stage--unknown"><div class="value-props-stage-top"><span class="value-props-number">01</span><span class="value-props-state">Unknown</span></div><h3>Start with an agent.</h3><p>A wallet address is an identifier, not yet a decision.</p><div class="value-props-identity"><span class="value-props-avatar">A</span><code>GD64YIY3…BHU5A</code><span class="value-props-pending">no context</span></div></article>
      <div class="value-props-connector" aria-hidden="true"><span>inspect</span><i></i></div>
      <article class="value-props-stage value-props-stage--evidence"><div class="value-props-stage-top"><span class="value-props-number">02</span><span class="value-props-state">Observable</span></div><h3>Collect the evidence.</h3><p>Trace the history and relationships your application can inspect.</p><div class="value-props-signals"><span>History</span><span>Relationships</span><span>Reputation</span><span>Sybil signals</span></div></article>
      <div class="value-props-connector" aria-hidden="true"><span>explain</span><i></i></div>
      <article class="value-props-stage value-props-stage--decision"><div class="value-props-stage-top"><span class="value-props-number">03</span><span class="value-props-state">Decision-ready</span></div><h3>Act with reasons attached.</h3><p>A deterministic verdict that carries its evidence with it.</p><div class="value-props-verdict"><strong>78</strong><span>/ 100</span><b>Low risk</b></div></article>
    </div>
  </Container>
</section>
